{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_delta","contentIndex":1,"delta":"{\"command\":\"export PATH=\\\"/home/phaedrus/development/misty-step/canopy:$PATH\\\"\\nbranch=\\\"forest/canopy-critic-discovery-id-collision/discovery-id-collision\\\"\\ngh pr create --head \\\"$branch\\\" --title \\\"Resolve discovery ID collisions deterministically\\\" --body \\\"Powder job: canopy-critic-discovery-id-collision\\n\\nDiscovery deduplicated roots but generated IDs with sanitizeID, so agent_test and agent-test both became agent-test. Reconciliation keyed workers/state by ID, silently dropping one checkout.\\n\\nThis change resolves collisions deterministically before worker/state reconciliation (Root-sorted, smallest -N suffix), preserves explicit inventory IDs/routes as authoritative, omits discovered roots already covered explicitly without presenting them as independent instances, and preserves ordinary noncolliding IDs.\\n\\nTests: TestResolveDiscoveryCollisionsRetainsCollidingSiblings, TestScanDevelopmentRootCollidingCheckoutsResolveToDistinctIDs, TestSyncDiscoveredInstancesResolvesCollidingIDs, TestSyncDiscoveredInstancesPreservesExplicitOnIDCollision, TestSyncDiscoveredInstancesOmitsExplicitRootDuplicate. Checks: go test ./... and go vet ./... pass.\\\" 2>&1; echo \\\"EXIT:$?\\\"\"}"}}
